  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1204.55 2-piece can exterior end coating",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1204.55 \"2-piece can exterior end coating\" means a coating applied by roller coating or spraying to the exterior end of a metal can to provide protection to the metal.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
